  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nununa Womens Shea Butter Degumming/Stabilization Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Shea.Beneficiaries: 5341 (5341 women).Description: The project will enable Nunuma to introduce an additional step into its semi-mechanized production process to supply degummed/stabilized product to its clients, mainly l&apos;Occitane. Higher quality/more uniform product will achieve better prices.</narrative>
  </description>
